  "description": "Inside the world’s most popular MMORPG, the fearsome Dragon of Despair Taphras is raided by the game’s most powerful guild, composed of six top-rankers. Upon Taphras' defeat, he is divided into six items and split between each of the guild members. Little do they know that Taphras’ sister, Ignis, the Dragon of Destruction, has been awoken. Now, to resurrect her brother, Ignis must take down the guild members one by one and unite the missing items in this dragon-sized tale of revenge!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
